  "id": "courgette-green-bean-and-feta-salad",
  "name": "Courgette, Green Bean and Feta Salad",
  "subtitle": "Grilled vegetables with baked feta and a crisp nutty topping",
  "description": "A warm summer salad combining tender courgettes and green beans with seasoned feta, citrus, breadcrumbs, and hazelnuts.",
